id: F02
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feFromBytes: boundary constant, top-limb truncation mask 8388607 (0x7FFFFF) widened to 16777215 (0xFFFFFF), letting an extra high bit of the input leak into h9 before the clamp.
====OLD====
  h9 = (h9 and 8388607) shl 2
====NEW====
  h9 = (h9 and 16777215) shl 2
====END====
